OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man village rallies for
OL,4,ANepal flood victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Manx village will raise money this
OL,7,Fweekend for victims of the recent
OL,8,Fdeadly flash flooding in Nepal.
OL,10,FThe people of Kirk Michael and Ghamrang
OL,11,Fin Nepal have been linked by a charity
OL,12,Fsince 1993.
OL,14,FA raffle and bake sale at the village
OL,15,Ffair will go towards the Pahar Trust
OL,16,FNepal, which builds and repairs
OL,17,Fearthquake-resilient schools, health
OL,18,Fcentres and sanitation facilities in
OL,19,Fremote mountain villages.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
